BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:meganisi-katomeri-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-katomeri-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270628
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270630
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agioi Apostoloi\, Katomeri
LOCATION:Katomeri\, Meganisi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Katomeri's parish church is dedicated to Peter and Paul and its feast on 29 June is the first panigiri of the Meganisi summer: vespers on the 28th\, liturgy and then food and music in the village square. Small island\, small crowd\, mostly locals and yacht crews from Vathy and Spartochori.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#katomeri-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-katomeri
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#katomeri-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-katomeri
END:VEVENT
