BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:meganisi-katomeri-feast-of-the-transfiguration-katomeri-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Feast of the Transfiguration\, Katomeri
LOCATION:Katomeri\, Meganisi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Transfiguration is kept at the church of the Saviour in Katomeri and at the Faneromeni monastery's dependency on the island\, with vespers on 5 August and liturgy on the 6th attended by the mayor and the monastery's abbot\; a reception follows. It is a church feast more than a party\, but it lands in the busiest week of the year and the tavernas of Katomeri fill afterwards.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#katomeri-feast-of-the-transfiguration-katomeri
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#katomeri-feast-of-the-transfiguration-katomeri
END:VEVENT
